WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:30.500
[Instrumental Intro]

00:00:31.112 --> 00:00:35.414
Headlights cut across the rain

00:00:39.115 --> 00:00:43.256
Wipers keep the beat on the window pane

00:00:46.117 --> 00:00:52.800
Static on the radio, fading in and out

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.782
We're just shadows in the dashboard lights

00:01:03.001 --> 00:01:07.222
Driving in the dark, running on neon fumes

00:01:07.623 --> 00:01:11.364
Leaving all the ghosts in their empty rooms

00:01:11.484 --> 00:01:16.800
This city's just a map of glowing, faded lines

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:22.787
But I'm safe right here, between your eyes and mine

00:01:25.448 --> 00:01:30.570
Midnight drivers, in the fading light

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:45.500
[Instrumental Break]

00:01:46.175 --> 00:01:50.356
The skyline's a promise, cold and blue

00:01:54.457 --> 00:01:59.500
I don't know this road, but I'm with you

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:07.500
The analog display is a steady green glow

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:14.123
Got no destination, just a place to go

00:02:18.125 --> 00:02:22.608
Driving in the dark, running on neon fumes

00:02:22.708 --> 00:02:26.610
Leaving all the ghosts in their empty rooms

00:02:26.710 --> 00:02:32.200
This city's just a map of glowing, faded lines

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:39.097
But I'm safe right here, between your eyes and mine

00:02:41.479 --> 00:02:46.582
Midnight drivers, in the fading light

00:02:53.205 --> 00:02:56.500
In the fading light...

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:09.500
[Outro]
